<section>
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-12">

    <h1 class="h15"><ruby>本<rt>ほん</rt></ruby>を<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>む</h1>

  </div>
</div>

<ul class="row small-gutters list-unstyled text-center fs-1rem lh-18">

  <!-- ========== JA ========== -->
  <!-- ◆無料の読みもの -->
  <li class="col-6 col-lg-3 col-xl-2 mb-3">
    <a class="d-flex flex-column text-decoration-none h-100 border bgc-l4-solid c-white px-3 py-4" href="https://tadoku.org/japanese/free-books">
